1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,500
You dare to challenge the Heavenly Sword Sect?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,200
Master, his cultivation has broken through again!

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,500
Impossible. Three days ago he was only at the third level.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
Senior brother, the tournament begins at sunrise.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,600
If I lose tomorrow, the whole clan will suffer.

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,900
Then do not lose. I will teach you the forbidden technique tonight.

7
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,000
But master, that technique destroyed an entire army!

8
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,800
Power always has a price. Are you willing to pay it?

9
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,000
For my family, I will pay any price.

10
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:32,500
Good. Then let the heavens witness your oath.
